msgid "Home"
msgstr "Bosh sahifa"

msgid "Browse Quizzes"
msgstr "Viktorinalarni ko'rish"

msgid "Create Quiz"
msgstr "Viktorina yaratish"

msgid "My Profile"
msgstr "Mening profilim"

msgid "Login"
msgstr "Kirish"

msgid "Logout"
msgstr "Chiqish"

msgid "Register"
msgstr "Ro'yxatdan o'tish"

msgid "Featured Quizzes"
msgstr "Tavsiya etilgan viktorinalar"

msgid "Play Now"
msgstr "Hozir o'ynash"

msgid "View Details"
msgstr "Batafsil ma'lumot"

msgid "Welcome to QuizBattle!"
msgstr "QuizBattle-ga xush kelibsiz!"

msgid "Create, share, and play fun educational quizzes with friends and students."
msgstr "Do'stlar va o'quvchilar bilan qiziqarli ta'limiy viktorinalarni yarating, ulashing va o'ynang."

msgid "Log In"
msgstr "Kirish"

msgid "Browse"
msgstr "Ko'rish"

msgid "Find quizzes to play or host for your friends and students."
msgstr "Do'stlaringiz va o'quvchilaringiz uchun o'ynash yoki o'tkazish mumkin bo'lgan viktorinalarni toping."

msgid "Create a Quiz"
msgstr "Viktorina yaratish"

msgid "Make your own custom quiz with multiple choice questions."
msgstr "Ko'p variantli savollar bilan o'zingizning viktorinangizni yarating."

msgid "Create"
msgstr "Yaratish"

msgid "Join a Game"
msgstr "O'yinga qo'shilish"

msgid "Join a game using a 6-digit code from the host."
msgstr "O'yin tashkilotchisidan olingan 6 xonali kod yordamida o'yinga qo'shiling."

msgid "Join"
msgstr "Qo'shilish"

msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Profil"

msgid "View your quizzes, game history, and statistics."
msgstr "Viktorinalaringiz, o'yin tarixi va statistikani ko'ring."

msgid "How to Play"
msgstr "Qanday o'ynash"

msgid "Create an Account"
msgstr "Hisob yaratish"

msgid "Sign up with an email address and password to get started."
msgstr "Boshlash uchun elektron pochta va parol bilan ro'yxatdan o'ting."

msgid "Host or Join a Game"
msgstr "O'yin o'tkazish yoki qo'shilish"

msgid "Create your own quiz to host, or join someone else's game with a code."
msgstr "O'z viktorinangizni yarating yoki kod bilan boshqa odamlarning o'yiniga qo'shiling."

msgid "Answer Questions"
msgstr "Savollarga javob bering"

msgid "Answer as quickly as possible to earn more points!"
msgstr "Ko'proq ball to'plash uchun iloji boricha tezroq javob bering!"

msgid "See the Results"
msgstr "Natijalarni ko'ring"

msgid "View the leaderboard to see how you and others scored."
msgstr "Siz va boshqalar qanday ball to'plaganini ko'rish uchun peshqadamlar jadvalini ko'ring."

msgid "questions"
msgstr "savollar"

msgid "Created by"
msgstr "Muallif:"

msgid "No featured quizzes yet."
msgstr "Hali tavsiya etilgan viktorinalar yo'q."

msgid "Browse All Quizzes"
msgstr "Barcha viktorinalarni ko'rish"

msgid "About QuizBattle"
msgstr "QuizBattle haqida"

msgid "QuizBattle is an interactive quiz platform designed for educational purposes. With QuizBattle, teachers, students, and quiz enthusiasts can create engaging quizzes, host game sessions, and join games in real-time."
msgstr "QuizBattle - ta'lim maqsadlari uchun mo'ljallangan interfaol viktorina platformasi. QuizBattle yordamida o'qituvchilar, o'quvchilar va viktorina ishqibozlari qiziqarli viktorinalarni yaratishlari, o'yin sessiyalarini tashkil qilishlari va real vaqtda o'yinlarga qo'shilishlari mumkin."

msgid "Features:"
msgstr "Xususiyatlar:"

msgid "Create custom quizzes with multiple-choice questions"
msgstr "Ko'p variantli savollar bilan o'z viktorinalaringizni yarating"

msgid "Host real-time quiz games with unique game codes"
msgstr "Noyob o'yin kodlari bilan real vaqt rejimida viktorina o'yinlarini o'tkazing"

msgid "Join games using 6-digit codes"
msgstr "6 xonali kodlardan foydalanib o'yinlarga qo'shiling"

msgid "Track your progress and scores"
msgstr "Yutuqlaringiz va ballaringizni kuzatib boring"

msgid "Compete with friends and classmates"
msgstr "Do'stlaringiz va sinfdoshlaringiz bilan raqobatlashing"

msgid "View detailed results after each game"
msgstr "Har bir o'yindan so'ng batafsil natijalarni ko'ring"
